Except 5 - 24, all follow the format ‘X - X²’ such as:

4 - 4² = 16;

6 - 6² = 36;

7 - 7² = 49;

But 5 - 5² = 25 ≠ 24.

Hence, 5 - 24 is different from other three responses.

The pattern followed here is;

22 - (22)² + 1 = 485;

12 - (12)² + 1 = 145;

6 - (6)² + 1 = 37;

**16 - (16)² + 1 = 257 ≠ 259**.

Hence, 16 – 259 is different from other three responses.
